yVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"QsgDdC2znJ763rFHilncZQ","review_id":"-IXtsWzah4pzPgMTOigOXg","date":"2018-01-17T21:47:13","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9445163011550903,"text_excerpt":"Pizza heaven! That's really all you need to know about this restaurant, but I'll tell you more... They have an excellent draught beer selection plus they have 4 stout beers on draught which is unheard of! I honestly wish I could sit out on the fabulous patio area drink stout and eat awesome pizza all afternoon especially with great company like I had on my first visit here. Except today because it's about 20 degrees outside which is totally not normal for New Orleans, but any other day I would really enjoy it. This is a small restaurant with a nice size bar and a few tables inside and nice amount of tables outside. The pizza is heaven so most definitely get a couple different ones to try...."},{"business_id":"QsgDdC2znJ763rFHilncZQ","review_id":"y7iwJO1wWqO0BP1mMfrsJA","date":"2017-04-09T23:10:33","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9405376315116882,"text_excerpt":"Love coming here for pizza in the warehouse area. Great outdoor seating, strong pizza selection, and an extensive beer list as well. The indoor seating is a little sparse, so this is mostly dependent on outdoor seating. Weather checks are a smart move prior to venturing out here. The pizzas are brick oven thin crust, with both classic and contemporary flavors. The beer selections have rotation seasonal. Overall an excellent place to visit for date night"},{"business_id":"QsgDdC2znJ763rFHilncZQ","review_id":"Fk3JOLQ_-3H9RVkeUpPljA","date":"2015-02-26T17:14:13","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9384964108467102,"text_excerpt":"I've been driving by this place, had no idea what the name of it was because there is no obvious sign. One day the traffic was really bad so I just parked and ate. First, I tried the scallops and cauliflower appetizer. I don't know why I was surprised, but it was a warm appetizer. Anyway the 2 scallops were tasty, and the whole dish well seasoned, not overly minted. I could have stopped eating there, But I ordered the Bianco Pizza. It was delicious with a crispy crust, and just the right amount of ricotta cheese topping. Next time I will order it with more red onion. Service was great (the inside seats about 25 and was half full, too cold for outside) and wine selection was decent for a p..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"QsgDdC2znJ763rFHilncZQ","photo_id":"BhEUErjkZV5oc_mOj6U0Vw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/BhEUErjkZV5oc_mOj6U0Vw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.923697829246521},{"business_id":"QsgDdC2znJ763rFHilncZQ","photo_id":"LpZF0Y5tO1e75Dvq927XaQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/LpZF0Y5tO1e75Dvq927XaQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8847702741622925},{"business_id":"QsgDdC2znJ763rFHilncZQ","photo_id":"e_A9N8DiV7Kp6CQKA1TVNg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/e_A9N8DiV7Kp6CQKA1TVNg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8409579992294312},{"business_id":"QsgDdC2znJ763rFHilncZQ","photo_id":"MhG1ODmvD3mJcN8iibax1A","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/MhG1ODmvD3mJcN8iibax1A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8064267039299011},{"business_id":"QsgDdC2znJ763rFHilncZQ","photo_id":"vXWtnLbqQ3g66MAiyuDcgg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/vXWtnLbqQ3g66MAiyuDcgg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7543430328369141}]},"notebook_case":null}
